# Quanttora Color System

Version: 1.0

---

# Philosophy

Colors should reduce stress.

Colors should communicate decisions.

Colors should never create excitement or panic.

---

## Primary

Deep Navy

Purpose:
Trust
Professionalism
Focus

---

## Secondary

White

Purpose:
Clarity
Space
Readability

---

## Success

Green

Used only when:

- Trading rules followed
- Mission completed
- Good discipline

Never use green only because profit occurred.

---

## Warning

Amber

Used for:

- High Risk
- Rule Reminder
- Low Confidence

---

## Danger

Red

Used only when:

- Daily loss reached
- Rule violation
- Stop trading

Never use red for normal losing trades.

---

## Background

Light Grey

Purpose:

Reduce eye fatigue.

---

# Rule

Every color must have a purpose.

Never decorate.

Always communicate.